uojGG ctGoIP pf-134_  custom-font2" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cbTzjv cciAhs pf-136_">Style is unique to every individual.<br>Style is appearance.<br>But it’s not just about what you wear.<br>Style is a habit that goes beyond fashion, trends and fads.<br>It’s a reflection of your personality and your confidence.<br>Style is something that comes from within.<br>Its your attitude.<br>It’s your way of doing things.<br></span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ctqQKy imxmpH pf-137_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0564/8859/1552/t/5/assets/pf-e5e5fd4e--c3_500x.jpg?v=1624088986" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0564/8859/1552/t/5/assets/pf-e5e5fd4e--c3.jpg?v=1624088986 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0564/8859/1552/t/5/assets/pf-e5e5fd4e--c3_1500x.jpg?v=1624088986 1280w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0564/8859/1552/t/5/assets/pf-e5e5fd4e--c3_1000x.jpg?v=1624088986 768w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0564/8859/1552/t/5/assets/pf-e5e5fd4e--c3_500x.jpg?v=1624088986 320w" width="8256" height="6192" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, 320px" loading="lazy" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-cZMNgc fhouYJ pf-138_"/></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-fHeRUh ixLxDV pf-139_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide"><div style="--cw:1158px" class="sc-evcjhq leJfDA"><div class="sc-iJKOTD qriss pf-140_  custom-font2 pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ctqQKy imxmpH pf-141_"><p class="sc-uojGG ctGoIP pf-142_  custom-font2" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cbTzjv cciAhs pf-144_">The Crimsoune Club logo symbolizes elegance and modernity. The twin deer pneumonic reflects the brand attitude of living life with grace and style. The brand colours - c